<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Ledger of Coin and Expense | Grand Victorian Edition</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;700;900&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-parchment: #fdf6e7;
            --bg-parchment-dark: #f0deba;
            --bg-parchment-light: #fffdf9;
            --ink-main: #1f1207;
            --ink-muted: #5e3b1c;
            --gold-bright: #f3c244;
            --gold-burnished: #c59325;
            --gold-dark: #7a520e;
            --accent-red: #c92a2a;
            --accent-red-glow: #ff5252;
            --accent-green: #087f5b;
            --accent-green-glow: #12b886;
            --card-bg: rgba(253, 246, 231, 0.94);
            --shadow-gold: 0 0 25px rgba(243, 194, 68, 0.25);
            --shadow-deep: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
            color: var(--ink-main);
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 9px; height: 9px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg-parchment-dark); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { 
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-burnished), var(--gold-dark)); 
            border-radius: 3px; 
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-bright);
        }

        body {
            background-color: #100a04;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, #3e1b0c 0%, #170903 60%, #080301 100%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 90%, rgba(197, 147, 37, 0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 30px 15px;
        }

        .ledger-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1260px;
            background: var(--bg-parchment);
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #fffdf8 30%, #f6e6c4 100%),
                linear-gradient(to right, rgba(197, 147, 37, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(197, 147, 37, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 100% 100%, 22px 22px, 22px 22px;
            border: 4px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-deep), var(--shadow-gold), inset 0 0 120px rgba(197, 147, 37, 0.22);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 25px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .corner-ornament {
            position: absolute;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            pointer-events: none;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .corner-tl { top: 14px; left: 16px; }
        .corner-tr { top: 14px; right: 16px; }

        .flourish-divider {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 6px 0 10px 0;
            user-select: none;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .gold-diamond {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            background: var(--gold-bright);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-dark);
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            margin-right: 8px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .screen {
            display: none;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(8px);
            transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s ease;
        }

        .screen.active {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 25px;
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .ledger-header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 50;
        }

        .ledger-header h1 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3d1c02 0%, #1f0b00 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 2px rgba(243, 194, 68, 0.4));
        }

        .sub-header-quote {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: var(--ink-muted);
            margin-top: 5px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .nav-ribbon {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 18px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 60;
        }

        .vintage-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f9eed4 0%, #e2c488 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 10px 22px;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            color: var(--ink-main);
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.15), inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
            border-radius: 3px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 70;
            user-select: none;
            touch-action: manipulation;
        }

        .vintage-btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fce09b 0%, #cfa13e 100%);
            border-color: var(--gold-dark);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(197, 147, 37, 0.4);
        }

        .vintage-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(1px);
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .vintage-btn.active {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #341f11 0%, #150902 100%);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            border-color: var(--gold-bright);
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(243, 194, 68, 0.5), inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }

        .vintage-btn.danger {
            border-color: var(--accent-red);
            color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .vintage-btn.danger:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #e03131 0%, #9b1111 100%);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: #5f0808;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(201, 42, 42, 0.45);
        }

        .home-content {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 10px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .home-banner {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7a1f1d, #c92a2a, #7a1f1d);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-bright);
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(201, 42, 42, 0.35);
            padding: 9px 30px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .home-text {
            max-width: 760px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.85;
            color: var(--ink-muted);
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .home-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 22px;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .home-box {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            border-top: 5px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(45, 25, 10, 0.1), inset 0 0 20px rgba(243, 194, 68, 0.1);
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        .home-box h4 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: var(--gold-dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .home-box p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--ink-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .metrics-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 22px;
        }

        @media(max-width: 800px) {
            .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .metric-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 22px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(40, 20, 5, 0.12);
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .metric-card::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 4px;
        }

        .metric-card.income::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #087f5b, #20c997); }
        .metric-card.expense::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c92a2a, #ff6b6b); }
        .metric-card.balance::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c59325, #ffd43b); }

        .metric-title {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--ink-muted);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .metric-amount {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .metric-card.income .metric-amount { color: var(--accent-green); }
        .metric-card.expense .metric-amount { color: var(--accent-red); }
        .metric-card.balance .metric-amount { color: var(--ink-main); }

        .ai-audit-panel {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(253, 246, 231, 0.98), rgba(240, 222, 186, 0.95));
            border: 2px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(40, 20, 5, 0.15), inset 0 0 35px rgba(243, 194, 68, 0.2);
            padding: 24px 28px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .ai-audit-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .ai-audit-title {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--gold-dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .ai-header-controls {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .ai-verdict-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3d1c02 0%, #1f0b00 100%);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 4px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
        }

        .re-audit-btn {
            background: var(--bg-parchment-dark);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--gold-dark);
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 3px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .re-audit-btn:hover {
            background: var(--gold-bright);
            color: var(--ink-main);
        }

        .ai-commentary-text {
            font-size: 1.08rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: var(--ink-main);
            font-style: italic;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 20px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            min-height: 48px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .workspace-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 350px 1.2fr 1fr;
            gap: 22px;
        }

        @media(max-width: 1100px) {
            .workspace-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .ledger-panel {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(40, 20, 5, 0.1);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .panel-title {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: var(--gold-dark);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .form-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .form-row label {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.6px;
            color: var(--ink-muted);
        }

        .parchment-input {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 10px 12px;
            font-size: 0.96rem;
            color: var(--ink-main);
            border-radius: 3px;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .parchment-input:focus {
            border-color: var(--gold-dark);
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(243, 194, 68, 0.5);
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        .type-selector {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .type-tab {
            background: #ede0c2;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .type-tab.active {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #382012 0%, #170902 100%);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            border-color: var(--gold-bright);
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(243, 194, 68, 0.4);
        }

        .ai-preview-tag {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--gold-dark);
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .quill-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3a2213 0%, #1a0b02 100%);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 12px;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
            transition: all 0.2s;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .quill-btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #57331b 0%, #291204 100%);
            border-color: var(--gold-bright);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(243, 194, 68, 0.45);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .quill-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(1px);
        }

        .chart-box {
            position: relative;
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 230px;
        }

        .no-data-notice {
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--ink-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: absolute;
        }

        .registry-panel {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(40, 20, 5, 0.1);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .registry-controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .filters-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .registry-table-wrap {
            max-height: 330px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        .registry-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .registry-table th {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #faeed6 0%, #ebd3a6 100%);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 10px 14px;
            color: var(--gold-dark);
            letter-spacing: 0.6px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .registry-table td {
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(197, 147, 37, 0.5);
        }

        .registry-table tr:hover {
            background: rgba(243, 194, 68, 0.18);
        }

        .category-badge {
            background: rgba(197, 147, 37, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--gold-dark);
            font-weight: 600;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .amount-col.income { color: var(--accent-green); font-weight: 700; }
        .amount-col.expense { color: var(--accent-red); font-weight: 700; }

        .action-btn {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-right: 8px;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .edit-link { color: var(--gold-dark); }
        .delete-link { color: var(--accent-red); }

        .empty-registry {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 26px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--ink-muted);
        }

        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
            display: none;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }

        .modal-card {
            background: var(--bg-parchment);
            border: 3px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-deep), var(--shadow-gold);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        #toastContainer {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 25px;
            right: 25px;
            z-index: 2000;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .toast-message {
            background: #fffdf9;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-dark);
            border-left: 6px solid var(--gold-bright);
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--ink-main);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            animation: slideIn 0.3s ease-out;
            border-radius: 2px;
            pointer-events: auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            from { transform: translateX(60px); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
        }

        .ledger-footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--ink-muted);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--gold-burnished);
            padding-top: 16px;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="ledger-container">
        <svg class="corner-ornament corner-tl" viewBox="0 0 32 32">
            <path d="M4 28V8C4 5.79 5.79 4 8 4H28M8 8H20M8 8V20" stroke="#c59325" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="4" height="4" fill="#f3c244" transform="rotate(45 8 8)"/>
        </svg>
        <svg class="corner-ornament corner-tr" viewBox="0 0 32 32">
            <path d="M28 28V8C28 5.79 26.21 4 24 4H4M24 8H12M24 8V20" stroke="#c59325" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
            <rect x="22" y="6" width="4" height="4" fill="#f3c244" transform="rotate(45 24 8)"/>
        </svg>

        <header class="ledger-header">
            <h1>The Ledger of Coin & Outflow</h1>
            <div class="sub-header-quote">"A meticulous account of wages, provisions, and the sovereign balance."</div>
            
            <div class="flourish-divider">
                <svg width="220" height="18" viewBox="0 0 220 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M0 9H85M135 9H220" stroke="#c59325" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    <path d="M110 2L116 9L110 16L104 9Z" fill="#f3c244" stroke="#c59325" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                    <circle cx="92" cy="9" r="2.5" fill="#c59325"/>
                    <circle cx="128" cy="9" r="2.5" fill="#c59325"/>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <nav class="nav-ribbon">
                <button type="button" class="vintage-btn active" id="navHomeBtn">Archive Home</button>
                <button type="button" class="vintage-btn" id="navDashBtn">The Vault Ledger</button>
                <button type="button" class="vintage-btn" id="exportCsvBtn">Export CSV</button>
                <button type="button" class="vintage-btn danger" id="clearAllBtn">Purge All Entries</button>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <main id="homeScreen" class="screen active">
            <div class="home-content">
                <div class="home-banner">Private Victorian Bookkeeping Register</div>
                <p class="home-text">
                    "He that will not keep a ledger of his pennies shall soon wonder why his gold has taken wings."
                    Maintain impeccable track of your trade earnings, apothecary items, domestic provisions, and remaining treasure securely within your browser vault.
                </p>
                
